  "description": "Others usually appear as a human when they possess a character in a book, but I possessed a doll... the favorite doll of a tyrant whose neck went flying because of the male lead.\n\n*\"I’ve already died once, but I don’t want to die again!\"\n\"To survive, I must edify the tyrant. To do that, I must first move my body… What? Oh, it’s moving?\"\n“Are you really Chloe? No, who are you?”*\n\nThe young emperor of the Burgundy Empire and a tyrant with the end faith of dying. Reclaim my body while edifying him!\n\n(Source: Comikey, edited)",
